.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
docs

# Patterns without **/ only match at the root of the build context (.):
# these are needed so backend/ and frontend/ local files never reach an
# image (`COPY backend/ ./` copies the whole folder).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
# Local SQLite database of the former legacy TodoList (a file named `data`).
**/legacy/persistence/data
npm-debug.log*
